The initial API-REV-008 web command passed an extra standalone `--` to the package script. Vitest treated the intended path list as post-separator arguments and began the repository-wide suite, where unrelated inherited glossary coverage failed. API/E2E interrupted the invalid harness invocation. It is not acceptance or product-failure evidence. The exact intended 34-file current selection was rerun with `pnpm test:nuxt --run <paths>` and is authoritative.
